cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Invisible Solar PK: estimating hidden rooftop PV from net load and satellite irradiance, with on-chain evidence anchoring"
abstract: >-
  Estimates behind-the-meter rooftop solar from a utility's hourly net load and free NASA POWER
  satellite irradiance (Irradiance-Residual Regression), validated on four Australian NEM regions
  where AEMO publishes rooftop PV, with Pakistan as the target case. Each estimate is anchored in
  a Solidity registry (BTMRegistry) together with the SHA-256 of its evidence file and of the
  estimator code, so anyone can re-hash the file and re-run the estimate.
authors:
